          "text": "The petitioner argues that the Court\u2019s fairness standard for reviewing prosecutors\u2019 closing arguments is a very general standard, and under AEDPA the State court should be given more leeway in reaching outcomes."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
